    "drive_up": false,
    "trail_note": "Park at the pullout before the locked gate on forestry road 7185 and walk the service road. Confirm open hours with the Kootenai National Forest; the 2022 visitor found the tower unmanned and climbing stopped at the stairs under the balcony."
  },
